                  %a{:href => "#general"} General
                %li
                  %a{:href => "#in_relation_to_flavour_anomalies"} In relation to flavour anomalies
          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            In
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/particle+physics"} particle physics
            the term
            %em Z’-boson
            refers to a hypothetical higher-
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mass"} mass
            cousin of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Z-boson"} Z-boson
            which is predicted by some
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+%28in+theoretical+physics%29"} models
            that extend the
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/standard+model+of+particle+physics"} standard model of particle physics
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/grand+unified+theories"} grand unified theories
            (e.g.
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Sahoo06"} Sahoo 06
          %p
            The existence of the
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Z
                  %mo ′
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z'
            has been proposed as one possible explanation of the apparently observed
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/flavour+anomalies"} flavour anomalies
            (
            %a{:href => "#GauldGoertzHaisch13"}> Gauld-Goertz-Haisch 13
            ,
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "#DAmbrosioIverPiccininiPolosa19"} D’Ambrosio-Iver-Piccinini-Polosa 19
          %h2#references References
          %h3#general General
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                Paul Langacker,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    The Physics of Heavy
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Z
                          %mo ′
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z'
                    Gauge Bosons
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0801.1345"} arXiv:0801.1345
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "http://pdg.lbl.gov/2017/"}> The Review of Particle Physics 2017
                ,
                %em
                  59.
                  = succeed "-boson" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Z
                          %mo ′
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z'
                (
                %a{:href => "http://pdg.lbl.gov/2017/reviews/rpp2017-rev-zprime-searches.pdf"}> pdf
                )
            %li
              %p
                %a{:href => "https://kjende.web.cern.ch/kjende/de/zpath_zprime.htm"} kjende.web.cern.ch/kjende/de/zpath_zprime.htm
            %li
              %p
                %em
                  %a{:href => "https://sites.google.com/site/zprimeguide/"} The Z’ Hunter’s Guide
          %p Experimental constraints:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/CMS+collaboration"}> CMS collaboration
              ,
              %em
                Search for an
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msub
                        %mi L
                        %mi μ
                      %mo −
                      %msub
                        %mi L
                        %mi τ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} L_\mu - L_\tau
                gauge boson using
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi Z
                      %mo →
                      %mn 4
                      %mi μ
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z \to 4\mu
                events in proton-proton collisions at
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msqrt
                        %mi s
                      %mo =
                      %mn 13
                      %mi TeV
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sqrt{s} = 13TeV
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1808.03684"}> arXiv:1808.03684
              )
          %p
            As arising in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/GUTs"} GUTs
          %ul
            %li#Sahoo06
              S. Sahoo,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  The prediction of mass of
                  = succeed "-boson" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi Z
                          %mo ′
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Z'
                  = succeed "-based" do
